@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title 统一 bootstrap: 新的 queue, realtime 其他 history root

autonumber
participant "Bridge instance" as Bridge
participant "Private Workspace API" as API
database "Workspace leases / tasks / mappings" as Workspace
participant "Zulip" as Zulip
participant "Sequential Realtime Connector" as Realtime
participant "History Importer" as History

API -> Workspace : choose healthy compatible instance\nby min(active_accounts / declared_capacity)
Workspace --> Bridge : sticky whole-account assignment
Bridge -> API : TLS 1.2+ mTLS certificate\nclaim whole account
API -> Workspace : authorize realm/provider/instance/identity generation
API -> Workspace : increment/lease fencing generation
API --> Bridge : account scope + generation

loop 接下来 registration 没有成功
  Bridge -> Zulip : register queue(supported event types only)
  alt registration failed
    Zulip --> Bridge : transient failure
    Bridge -> Bridge : bounded backoff
  else queue registered
    Zulip --> Bridge : queue + registration boundary
    Bridge -> Realtime : start sequential consumption from boundary
    Bridge -> API : ensure history root(account, selection,\nboundary, generation)
    API -> Workspace : idempotent root task
    API --> Bridge : created / duplicate
  end
end

par Realtime 优先级较高
  Realtime -> Zulip : next supported event
  Realtime -> API : one command + provider keys + generation
  API -> Workspace : canonical mutation + outbox
  API --> Realtime : applied / duplicate / stale / permanent
else Finite history
  History -> API : claim root, create per-stream tasks
  API -> Workspace : durable task lifecycle
  History -> Zulip : snapshot/range before boundary
  History -> API : same idempotent commands/provider keys
end

alt queue expiry / missing heartbeat / restart / web_reload_client
  Realtime -> Bridge : lifecycle signal
  Bridge -> Bridge : discard local queue/cache
  note right of Bridge
    重复整个 bootstrap.
    Old queue/cursor 没有 durable state.
  end note
end

note over Realtime,History
  Boundary + 它们是相同的 provider keys 他们给 overlap-safe no-gap.
  Durable leases, mappings, tasks 其他 operations 属于 Workspace.
  在 Bridge 没有共同的 database.
end note

note over Bridge,Workspace
  mTLS service identity and account lease are independent checks.
  Realtime + history 一个 account 有一个 owner.
  Heartbeat 10s; degraded 30s; offline/takeover 60s.
  Healthy assignments 没有重新平衡; graceful stop releases lease.
end note

@enduml
